.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt UNMAP 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm unmap
.Nd unmap memory from a process
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ft int
.Fn unmap "Handle proc" "usize addr" "usize len"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The .Nm system call unmaps a range from .Fa proc.
.Pp
This page documents the native RavenBSD ABI; see the
.Pa raven-abi
crate for the exact numeric value and types.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
On success .Nm returns a non-negative value; on failure it returns a negative error number.
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
